# ================= CORE CALORIE ADVISOR — git exclusions =================
# Created by §0.4 PRE-FLIGHT before `git init`, so that no secret ever
# enters git history. Do not reorder: .env MUST stay listed.

# Secrets — .env holds 20 live keys (Anthropic, Stripe, Google/Facebook/Instagram OAuth, DB)
.env

# Runtime / user data — not product source
logs/
uploads/

# _audit/ IS tracked (owner decision 2026-07-31): it holds the phase reports, the
# garment-failure evidence PNGs referenced from cca-wardrobe.js:16, and the
# _audit/opaque-check.mjs regression guard — losing those loses the reasoning
# behind current design decisions. The 16.9 MB _backup-2026-07-30.zip inside it
# stays excluded by the *.zip rule below: it is a backup archive, not evidence.

# Database dumps: three of these carry real user rows — 33 bcrypt password
# hashes and 33 unique email addresses across the three files. Same reasoning as
# .env: git history is permanent, so credentials must never enter it. The
# schema-only dump (pre-migration-workouts-exercises.sql, 0 hashes) is harmless
# but excluded with the rest to keep one simple rule.
_audit/db-backup/

# Archives & backups
*.zip
*.bak
*.old
tmp/
